# CODEOWNERS for insight-ui
#
# Paths in this file map to GitHub users or teams that are responsible for
# reviewing and maintaining those parts of the codebase. Code owners are
# requested automatically on every pull request that touches a matching path.
#
# Syntax:
#   path  @github-username
#   path  @org/team-name
#
# Note: a bare organisation handle (@alpininsight) is not a valid code owner --
# GitHub only accepts individual users and org teams. Naming the maintainers
# directly is what makes the review request actually fire.

